    "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/h4chub/kapkan-releases/tarball/v1.0.1-beta.1",
    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/h4chub/kapkan-releases/zipball/v1.0.1-beta.1",
    "body": "KapKan 1.0.1 makes first-time Minecraft asset downloads faster and shows what is happening while you wait.\r\n\r\n## What changed\r\n\r\n- Downloads up to six Minecraft assets at a time instead of one at a time.\r\n- Shows the current stage, completed file count, measured download speed and estimated time remaining.\r\n- Reuses verified cached files and downloads duplicate content only once. Repairs missing or damaged assets without downloading everything again.\r\n- Keeps file size/hash validation, bounded retries and safe cancellation.\r\n- Retains the existing launcher design, in-game menu, capes and skin importer.\r\n\r\nA controlled local HTTP test took 12.07 seconds with one worker and 1.94 seconds with six workers. This measures that test workload, not an internet speed or total startup-time guarantee. Real times depend on your connection, device and Minecraft version.\r\n\r\n## Download and update\r\n\r\n**macOS:** download `KapKan-macOS-1.0.1.zip`, close Minecraft and KapKan, extract it and move the included `KapKan.app` into Applications, replacing the old app.\r\n\r\n**Windows x64:** download `KapKan-1.0.1-Setup.exe`, close Minecraft and KapKan, then run the installer.\r\n\r\nUpdates are manual. Keep your existing `.kapkan` data directory to retain your worlds, mods and preferences. `SHA256SUMS.txt` identifies the exact downloadable files.\r\n\r\n## Beta scope\r\n\r\nThe in-game companion targets **Minecraft 26.1.2, Fabric Loader 0.19.5 or newer, and Java 25**. Other versions/loaders offered by the launcher do not all have these features or completed compatibility testing.\r\n\r\nMicrosoft sign-in is not preconfigured with a KapKan-owned application ID. Shared badges/capes need a configured HTTPS service; no shared endpoint is included by default. Imported skins remain local. Friends, managed server creation and Premium are not available in this release.\r\n\r\nThese packages are unsigned; macOS is not Developer ID notarized. Download/recovery tests, Linux UI checks and package integrity audits passed. Installation and gameplay on these exact Mac/Windows packages still need native confirmation. This is an early public beta.\r\n"
